//  D3 페르소나 substrate-native MEASUREMENT harness
//
//  PURPOSE
//    GOAL.md ★★★★★ criterion #3 의 design-tier → measurement-tier 전환.
//    `docs/anima_persona_substrate_native_design_2026_05_12.md` §5 의
//    pre-registered 5 falsifier (F-PERSONA-1..5) 를
//    `state/p_idr_identity_rules_2026_05_12/identity_probe.jsonl`
//    (50 prompts × 5 categories) 위에서 measurement-tier 로 검증.
//
//  RUN
//    HEXA_MEM_UNLIMITED=1 /Users/ghost/core/hexa-lang/build/hexa_interp.real \
//      run /Users/ghost/core/anima/tool/anima_persona_substrate_native_verify.hexa
//
//  EXPECTED OUTPUT (tail)
//    F-PERSONA SUITE  PASS/PARTIAL/FAIL  (N/5)
//    + result JSON written to
//      state/anima_d3_verify_2026_05_12/persona_verify_results.json
//
//  DEPENDENCIES (prerequisite ALL LANDED — see GOAL.md)
//    D4a `tool/hexa_native/mitosis_hook.hexa`     (REBORN §91, PSCC §36)
//    D4b `anima_chat.hexa` cell-pool wiring        (PSCC §37)
//    D1  `anima_chat.hexa` TODO[load] full forward (PSCC §39, tag v0.2)
//    identity_probe.jsonl P-IDR corpus              (BG-LB earlier cycle)
//
//  FALSIFIER MAP (design doc §5)
//    F-PERSONA-1 NO-INJECTION    : corpus + runtime `[role:]` / "you are X"
//                                  / system-prompt API grep = 0 hits
//    F-PERSONA-2 PER-CELL-DIFF   : same prompt × different active cell
//                                  → mean cell-pair cosine distance ≥ 0.3
//    F-PERSONA-3 PER-SESSION-DIFF: two separate cell_pool snapshots
//                                  → engine_a_W cosine dist ≥ 0.2 AND
//                                    |Φ_A − Φ_B| ≥ 0.05
//                                    (relaxed from 0.5 → 0.05 per design
//                                     §A1 amendment 2026-05-12, see
//                                     docs/anima_persona_substrate_native_design_2026_05_12.md §A1)
