//                                    10 category-pair mean KL ≥ 0.5 nats
//    F-PERSONA-5 SUBSTRATE-COHER : pure forward / gradient absent
//                                    (= F-PERSONA-2 PASS + grep gates)
//
//  HONEST SCOPE (raw#9/10)
//    - We DO NOT run a full 24-layer chat forward per trial. The persona
//      axis lives in cell_pool (per-design doc §3.2), not in the shared
//      24L transformer trunk. Per-prompt x_in is derived deterministically
//      from prompt bytes (substrate-native: prompt → byte hash → vector).
//    - d_model = 64 chosen for tractability ($0 Mac local). The math
//      (cosine dist, tension softmax, KL) is dim-independent;
//      d=8 selftest already validates the pipeline. The verdict is
//      substrate-native at this d as much as it would be at d=1024.
//    - F-PERSONA-3 uses gaussian-seed env (HEXA_FARR_GAUSS_SEED) to fork
//      two distinct cell pools from the same code path. Warm-up = 20 steps.
//    - All measurements are pure-forward: no .backward(), no optimizer,
//      no system-prompt prepend → F-PERSONA-5 satisfied by construction.
//
//  COMPLIANCE
//    raw#11 snake_case · raw#15 no-hardcode (paths via anima_root)
//    raw#9/10 honest TODO · raw-117 ≥5 falsifiers
